OL,3,GNEWSASouth east council reorganisation
OL,4,Aplans clarified
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe south east of England has been
OL,7,Fgiven clarity over local government
OL,8,Freorganisation (LGR) plans before final
OL,9,Fdecisions are made.
OL,11,FA two unitary council proposal for East
OL,12,FSussex and Brighton, excluding Falmer,
OL,13,Fis being taken forward, while West
OL,14,FSussex remains awaiting a decision and
OL,15,Fplans in Surrey are unaffected.
OL,17,FA plan, which would have seen all 14
OL,18,FKent councils replaced by four larger
OL,19,Funitary authorities, has now been
OL,20,Fwithdrawn, though the government has
OL,21,Fstressed LGR is not cancelled.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
