OL,3,GNEWSASouth east council reorganisation
OL,4,Aplans clarified
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal government minister Jim McMahon
OL,7,Ftold the House of Commons on Thursday
OL,8,F"every area will have an outcome by
OL,9,Fearly next year".
